---
description: Rules for the review screen and mind map (Cursor-owned issues E5-5, E7-2, E7-3, E8-2)
globs: ["web/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- There is no send, connect or message button anywhere in the UI. Copy buttons only.
- Every contact card shows its source link and a confidence label.
- Email guesses are labelled "unverified" wherever they appear.
- Render data from the API payload only; do not fetch third-party pages from the browser.
